@startuml
title Purchase ticket state diagram

[*] --> Authentication

Authentication --> SeatSelection : user is valid
Authentication --> [*] : user is not valid

SeatSelection --> Booked : book places

Booked --> WaitingPayment : start payment

WaitingPayment --> Purchased : bank confirmed
WaitingPayment --> Cancelled : timeout 15 min

Booked --> Cancelled : timeout 15 min

Purchased --> EmailSent : send confirm email
EmailSent --> [*]

Cancelled --> SeatsReleased : mark seats available
SeatsReleased --> [*]
@enduml